%% TECH-017 Limit admin sign-in attempts
%% The attempt is counted before the password is checked.
flowchart TD
    A[Password sent on /admin/login] --> B["Count the attempt for the address R1"]
    B --> C{More than 5 within 15 minutes?}
    C -- yes --> D["För många försök, N minuter left R2 R3"]
    C -- no --> E{Right password?}
    E -- no --> F["Wait 1 s, Fel lösenord R4"]
    E -- yes --> G["Clear the count, sign in R1 R4"]
